      "text": "Pair scored. Markers (0 middle, 1 seat 1, 2 seat 2): Geisha 1 {marker_1}, Geisha 2 {marker_2}, Geisha 3 {marker_3}, Geisha 4 {marker_4}, Geisha 5 {marker_5}. Your Charm: {charm}; your Geisha: {geisha_count}."
